  "keyFeatures": [
    "AI-powered growth check-ins with Grok LLM coaching and reflection history",
    "Personal reflection agents with multi-turn sessions and persistent memory",
    "Full-featured moderation suite including AI automod rules and verification",
    "Community engagement tools: challenges, badges, OG claims, weekly awards",
    "Ticket support system with AI summaries and private channel management",
    "Customizable onboarding flows with rules, questions, and role assignment",
    "Recurring and event-based reminder scheduling with image support (Premium)",
    "Innersync ID linking Discord accounts to a unified cross-platform identity",
    "Premium tier with higher AI limits, Mockingbird mode, and image reminders",
    "HTTP API for dashboard integrations, agent sessions, and webhook automation"
  ],
